  "mechanism": [
    "The repository collection hook detects selected scanner tests and raises UsageError for group- or other-writable trusted inputs.",
    "Pytest still calls collection_finish in its finally block, so xdist receives collected item IDs even though collection subsequently exits with usage-error status 4.",
    "Worker sessionfinish emits workerfinished with exitstatus 4 and no shouldfail/shouldstop marker; no runtestloop is entered.",
    "The installed controller handles status 2 specially but otherwise removes that node from scheduling. Pending items trigger its crashitem assertion; draining active nodes before scheduling produces the no-active-workers alternative."
  ],
